{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmyKkEJxefENSiUc9WDL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm going with **Harel, the \"מניות\" track (קופה 8522)**. I'm fairly sure, not fully. What decided it: Harel is a name I actually know. That track shows **24.04%** for 3 years, the first big number I saw and it stuck with me. It also had the cheapest fee on the page, **0.55%**, with \"0%\" on deposits. I'd put the 30K in there, and as far as I can tell the first thing to do is go to Harel and open it.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** big heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". The \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" button was already picked, so I stayed. Row of track filters. I skipped the grey text under the heading. First company was Harel, \"דמי ניהול 0.54% עד 0.61%\".\n- **Screen 2:** Harel's tracks. \"מניות\" jumped out at 24.04% for 3 years and 14.64% for 5. The S&P 500 track my friends talk about only had 13.7%. Many tracks just said \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" instead of a number, so I passed over them.\n- **Screens 3 to 8:** scrolled through Mor, Analyst and Meitav. Analyst's \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\" had 26.39%, and Meitav's \"עוקב מדדי מניות\" had 25.86%. That's a bit more, but the fees were higher (0.61%, 0.65%). Two points' difference didn't feel worth leaving a name I know.\n- **Stopped after screen 8.** Same rows over and over, 143 of them. On screens 7 and 8 I couldn't even tell which company I was looking at, because the company name had scrolled off the top. I never opened screens 9 to 15.\n\n**What I didn't get:**\n- \"חשיפה למניות ולמט\"ח\": two percents next to a round chart. I guessed the green is shares and the yellow is dollars.\n- \"מט\"ח\"\n- \"ההפקדות\" vs \"ההחיסכון\"\n- \"קופה\" with numbers like 8522\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\"\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" with an orange mark\n- The \"(עד 25% מניות)\" tracks\n- \"כסף מנוהל\" in billions. Not sure it matters to me.\n\n**What annoyed me:**\n- Every row repeats the same labels: \"ההחיסכון\", \"ההפקדות 0%\", \"מניות\", \"מט\"ח\", \"3 שנים\", \"5 שנים\". I kept re-reading them to find what was actually different.\n- The column headers sit far from the numbers.\n- The page never tells me which track to pick.\n\n**Not sure I read it right:** the header says \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\". So I take 24% as per year, which would mean my money more than triples in 10 years. That sounds almost too good, but that's how it reads."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3753,"cache_read_input_tokens":15627,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3753},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"de91f744-9d63-4ee6-a3e3-6787f6e8c88f","uuid":"16804864-6dc6-4dcb-98bc-a56bc08b6425","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:14:53.736Z","request_id":"req_011CgmyKk2AKYSVKGC4AocQM"}
